BT 1 0 0 1 0 88.4 Tm 14 TL .094118 .192157 .25098 rg /F2+0 9.6 Tf 14 TL (We prove improved zero-density estimates for the Riemann zeta function, strengthening our previously) Tj T* (announced bounds in several ranges. Let N\(\001,T\) count the nontrivial zeros \002 with Re \002 \003 \001 and |Im \002| \004 T,) Tj T* (counted with multiplicity. For T \003 2 and \005 > 0, we obtain bounds of the form N\(\001,T\) \004) Tj T* (C\(\001,\005\)T^\(\(1\006\001\)A\(\001\)+\005\). In particular, we may take A\(\001\)=12/\(9\001\0061\) for 5/7 \004 \001 \004 113/153 and) Tj T* (A\(\001\)=255/\(153\001+7\) for 113/153 \004 \001 \004 3/4. We also obtain a sequence of bounds for 7/9 < \001 \004 7/8. The) Tj T* (complete estimates and their ranges are given in an accompanying table and compared graphically with) Tj T* (earlier bounds. The results are formalized in Lean.) Tj T* ET
